      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<h2>Weatherwise</h2><p><em>Storms are honest. People are not.</em></p><hr /><h3>Rules</h3><p>You gain a skill rank in Athletics (Violence) or Lore (Mind) (your choice). If you are already proficient, you gain mastery instead.</p><p>When you finish a Sanctuary, you may ask the GM one question about the next day’s travel conditions (wind, precipitation, visibility, or temperature extremes). The GM answers truthfully, in broad terms.</p>",
